    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n52471" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κᾰλάϊνος</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καλλάϊνος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>like the</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάλαϊς</span>, <i>shifting between blue
				and green</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. πτέρυξ</span>, of
			the cock, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				7.428.2
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Mel.
			</span></i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Χρῶμα κ.</span>, of jasper, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				5.142
			</span></i>; =
			<i>venetus</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lyd.
				<u>Mens.</u>
				4.30
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Tab.Defix.Aud.</u>
				15.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				16.13
			</span></i> (Syria, <span class="entity">iii A.D.</span>, written <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καλλαεινου</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καλαεινου</span>)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">; κ. λίθος</span>,
				= sq., <i><span class="en">
				<u>Peripl.M.Rubr.</u>
				39
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καλλεανός</span> cod.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλινθίς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					6.295.6
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Phan.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. κέραμος</span>
