				<u>EM</u>
				486.51
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ὄστρακον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					12.866
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ καλάϊνα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PSI</u>
					4.396.9
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>.</div>
